sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as User Admin
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>AdminIssueReportsPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ViewAllIssueReportsBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ViewAllIssueReportsController
  participant IssueReport as «entity»<br/>IssueReport
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: see all issue reports
  UI->>B: GET /api/admin/issue-reports (JWT)
  B->>C: list(IssueReportStatus status, IssueReportType type, Pageable pageable)
  C->>IssueReport: search()
  IssueReport->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>IssueReport: rows
  IssueReport-->>C: result
  C-->>B: PageResponse<IssueReportResponse>
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result